{"words":[{"surface":"மட","parts":[{"text":"மட","lemma":"மட","gloss":"gentle"}],"gloss":"gentle","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிடி","parts":[{"text":"பிடி","lemma":"பிடி","gloss":"female elephant"}],"gloss":"female elephant"},{"surface":"தழீஇ","parts":[{"text":"தழீஇ","lemma":"தழுவு","gloss":"embracing"}],"gloss":"embracing"},{"surface":"தடக்கை","parts":[{"text":"தடக்கை","lemma":"தடக்கை","gloss":"large-trunked"}],"gloss":"large-trunked","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"male elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குன்ற","parts":[{"text":"குன்ற","lemma":"குன்ற","gloss":"of the hill"}],"gloss":"of the hill","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குடி","parts":[{"text":"குடி","lemma":"குடி","gloss":"settlement"}],"gloss":"hamlet"},{"surface":"இழிதரு","parts":[{"text":"இழி","lemma":"இழி","gloss":"descend"},{"text":"தரு","lemma":"தரு","gloss":"auxiliary"}],"gloss":"descending"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"common ground"}],"gloss":"common ground","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணிய","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"approached"}],"gloss":"reached"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"கிழவோற்கே","parts":[{"text":"கிழவோன்","lemma":"கிழவோன்","gloss":"lord"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to the lord indeed"}]}],"literal":"The north wind having come, in the last days of sparse rain, / to cross the pain and end the deep distress, if you, kindly / speak, what is the harm, O friend? To the fragrant-breathed / gentle female elephant embracing, large-trunked male elephant, / descending from the small hamlet on the hill, / reaching the common ground, to the lord of the mountain.","translation":"O friend! What would happen if you kindly spoke to the lord of the mountain, who comes down to the common ground of our small hill-hamlet, like a large-trunked male elephant embracing his gentle, sweet-breathed mate, so that we may cross this pain and end our deep distress in these final days of sparse rain brought by the north wind?","modern":"வடக்காற்று வீசுகின்ற, சில துளிகளே பெய்யும் மழைக் காலத்தின் இறுதி நாட்களில், நம்முடைய துன்பத்தைக் கடந்து, அரிய துயரம் தீருமாறு, நீ விரும்பி அவனிடம் பேசினால் என்ன தவறு, தோழி? நறுமணம் வீசும் மூச்சினையுடைய மென்மையான பெண் யானையைத் தழுவிக்கொண்டு, பெரிய துதிக்கையையுடைய ஆண் யானையானது குன்றின் மேலுள்ள சிறிய குடியிருப்பை நோக்கி இறங்கி வந்து, மன்றத்தை அடையும் மலைநாட்டிற்குரிய தலைவனிடம் நீ பேசினால் என்ன?","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine during the difficult season of late rains and cold north winds, which intensifies the pain of waiting for the hero. She suggests that the heroine should kindly speak to the mountain lord when he visits secretly, urging him to make their union public. The poem uses the vivid image of a large-trunked male elephant embracing its gentle, sweet-breathed mate as they descend to the village common ground. This image of natural affection serves as a gentle hint that the hero, who is the lord of this mountain, should likewise embrace his responsibility and marry the heroine openly. The setting of the cold season highlights the urgency of ending the heroine's distress.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.4],[2.44,2.8],[2.8,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.7],[4.7,4.8],[4.8,5.3],[5.91,6.2],[6.2,7.0],[7.0,7.13],[7.13,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.42],[8.74,9.06],[9.06,9.06],[9.06,9.06],[9.06,9.7],[9.7,11.7],[11.7,12.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.7],[2.7,3.22],[3.22,3.3],[3.3,4.3],[4.3,5.3],[5.3,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,7.6],[7.6,7.6],[7.6,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,9.42],[10.04,10.66],[10.66,10.66],[10.66,10.66],[10.66,11.9],[11.9,12.4],[12.4,12.7]]}}